{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Scan for visible and reachable object, approach and grab it, check its light level and process it. Or scan for objects. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReachable    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectLight    /> <Action ID = CheckLightLevel    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    />",
